<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman downgrades Astra.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman downgrades Astra.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish drug group Astra AB was cut to &quot;market performer&quot; from &quot;market outperformer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the U.S. investment bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately avaialble.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
